 */
/* ===========================================
   TABELA DE REFERÊNCIA RÁPIDA
   =========================================== */
/*
| Breakpoint | Min Width | Max Width | Container | Gutter | Colunas |
|------------|-----------|-----------|-----------|--------|---------|
| XS         | 320px     | 639px     | 100%      | 8px    | 4       |
| SM         | 640px     | 1023px    | 608px     | 16px   | 8       |
| MD         | 1024px    | 1439px    | 960px     | 24px   | 12      |
| LG         | 1440px    | 1919px    | 1280px    | 32px   | 12      |
| XL         | 1920px    | 3839px    | 1600px    | 40px   | 12      |
| 4K         | 3840px    | ∞         | 1600px    | 48px   | 12      |
*/
